sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KServe as KServe Gateway
    participant HTTP as OVMS HTTP Server<br/>rest_port/TCP HTTP
    participant GRPC as OVMS gRPC Server<br/>grpc_port/TCP gRPC
    participant MP as MediaPipe Graph<br/>LLM Calculator
    participant OV as OpenVINO Runtime
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3/GCS/Azure<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: REST Model Inference (TFS/KServe v2)
    Client->>KServe: POST /v2/models/{model}/infer<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (optional)
    KServe->>HTTP: Forward to OVMS pod<br/>Port: rest_port/TCP
    HTTP->>HTTP: Validate Bearer token<br/>(if --api_key_file configured)
    HTTP->>OV: In-process inference call
    OV-->>HTTP: Inference result
    HTTP-->>KServe: JSON Response
    KServe-->>Client: Prediction Result

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: LLM Streaming Inference (OpenAI-compatible)
    Client->>HTTP: POST /v3/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (optional)<br/>stream: true
    HTTP->>MP: Route to LLM Calculator
    MP->>OV: Continuous batching inference<br/>(OpenVINO GenAI)
    loop Token Generation
        OV-->>MP: Generated token
        MP-->>HTTP: Token chunk
        HTTP-->>Client: SSE event (chunked/streaming)
    end
    HTTP-->>Client: SSE [DONE]

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 3: Model Download from HuggingFace
    HTTP->>HF: GET model repo<br/>Auth: HF token (optional)<br/>TLS: System CAs
    HF-->>HTTP: Model metadata
    HTTP->>HF: Git LFS download<br/>TLS: System CAs
    HF-->>HTTP: Model artifacts

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 4: gRPC Inference
    Client->>GRPC: PredictionService.Predict<br/>InsecureServerCredentials (no TLS)
    GRPC->>OV: In-process inference call
    OV-->>GRPC: Inference result
    GRPC-->>Client: gRPC Response
